# The two published content files are signed byte for byte (raw-bytes/v1). No line-ending conversion
# may touch them on checkout, or `shasum -a 256` would stop matching contentHash.sha256.
core.md -text
map.yaml -text

# docs/index.html is compared byte for byte with a fresh generation (`npm run check:page`), and
# README.md is one of the three inputs whose SHA-256 the page embeds. Neither may be converted either.
docs/index.html -text
README.md -text
